ENTROPY THRESHOLD INSIGHT:
  The lonely and non-lonely entropy distributions OVERLAP —
  there's no clean threshold. Some non-lonely times have
  higher entropy than some lonely times.

  But the MEDIAN entropy of lonely times is consistently HIGHER.
  Loneliness CORRELATES with high entropy, even if it doesn't
  DETERMINE it. The entropy is a WITNESS, not a certificate.

